      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name reflects its location on Long Island Sound, and the Civic Association was created to boost community life.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.soundbeachcivic.org/2022/10/18/into-the-looking-glass-of-history/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Sound Beach sits atop the Ronkonkoma moraine, the southernmost moraine that forms Long Island’s backbone.",
