      ],
      "source": "https://www.soundbeachcivic.org/2022/10/18/into-the-looking-glass-of-history/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The coastline is sandy near the cliffs and gradually turns rockier toward the shore, with stairs rebuilt after winter storms.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
