        26
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sound_Beach%2C_New_York",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Year‑round passes are required to access Sound Beach’s beaches, which are constantly threatened by harsh winter storms.",
